stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Observe
    Observe --> Diagnose: normalized trace summary
    Diagnose --> Preregister: hypothesis + mediator + controls
    Preregister --> Intervene: one intended factor
    Intervene --> Validate: matched randomized block
    Validate --> Supported: outcome + mediator pass
    Validate --> Rejected: predicted effect absent/reversed
    Validate --> Inconclusive: unstable, confounded, underpowered
    Supported --> UpdateEvidence
    Rejected --> UpdateEvidence
    Inconclusive --> Redesign
    Redesign --> Preregister
    UpdateEvidence --> SynthesizePolicy
    SynthesizePolicy --> Holdout
    Holdout --> Release: regret and quality pass
    Holdout --> Observe: drift or failure
    Release --> [*]
